{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>ECHOING SILENCE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t always about what you see\u2026 but what you feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The air weighs on your lungs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The darkness breathes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each step echoes like a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And not every expedition finds its way back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/Steam_GIF_01_V1.gif?t=1748274548\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the silence and the darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast underground maze where silence and darkness are your only companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some secrets buried here were never meant to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your path will define your fate \u2014 a great discovery\u2026 or being lost forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/Steam_GIF_03_V1.gif?t=1748274548\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the isolation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunger. Thirst. Exhaustion. Constant enemies\u2026 offering no mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mind may hold\u2026 or it may break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The real danger might not be ahead \u2014 but all around you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/Steam_GIF_04_V1.gif?t=1748274548\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Light is your ally\u2026 but for how long?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use flashlights, lanterns, and glowsticks wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every shadow is empty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And when the light goes out, only your footsteps will remain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add <strong>Echoing Silence</strong> to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you have the courage to face the darkness\u2026 and the silence?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3151230?t=1748274548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/be427ba25e5e578d27ecfad19b3f9485aedfed90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748274548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/f6d205b8c3d04ddc77fccccc0b3b66672dd5a499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748274548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/f6d205b8c3d04ddc77fccccc0b3b66672dd5a499/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748274548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work: Includes frequent violence, mature themes, and disturbing elements."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>ECHOING SILENCE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t always about what you see\u2026 but what you feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The air weighs on your lungs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The darkness breathes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each step echoes like a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And not every expedition finds its way back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s